---
title: "refund (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: investor requests refund
    q_check_paused --> q_check_period: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_period --> q_check_position: block.timestamp >= endTime AND block.timestamp < refundEndTime
    q_check_period --> q_revert_period: outside refund period
    q_check_position --> q_check_refunded: position.investedCapital > 0
    q_check_position --> q_revert_no_capital: no capital to refund
    q_check_refunded --> q_update: position has not already refunded
    q_check_refunded --> q_revert_already: already refunded
    q_update --> q_transfer: refundAmount = position.investedCapital, position.investedCapital = 0, totalInvestedCapital -= refundAmount
    q_transfer --> q_emit: transfer(investor, refundAmount)
    q_transfer --> q_revert_transfer: transfer failed
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Refunded(investor, refundAmount)
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_revert_period --> [*]: revert InvalidRefundPeriod
    q_revert_no_capital --> [*]: revert NoCapital
    q_revert_already --> [*]: revert AlreadyRefunded
    q_revert_transfer --> [*]: revert TransferFailed

    note right of q_update
        INV-001: After refund, position.investedCapital == 0
        INV-002: totalInvestedCapital decremented by exact refund amount
        INV-003: State update before external transfer (CEI pattern)
    end note
